    <string name="data_storage_android_playback_title">Reproductio in scaena postica Androidea</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_playback_body">Sonō ludente, Retro Player ministerium mediorum in primo planō administrat, ut lusus continuētur sī telephonum claudis aut applicationes mutās, cum gubernaculis vectoriis in notificatione systematis. Applicationem e Recentibus amovēre lusionem interficit et notificationem tollit.</string>
